#. module: qing_mail
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_qing_mail
msgid ""
"Improve domestic business email handling: assign outgoing servers to "
"companies, require the authenticated mailbox as sender, record recoverable "
"incoming failures and retry them using native mail workflows."
msgstr "改进国内业务邮件处理：为发件服务器指定公司、要求以已认证邮箱作为发件人、记录可恢复的收件失败，并通过原生邮件流程重试。"

